# LG K20 Plus (MSM8917) out-of-tree modules. Same shape as the OPPO tree:
# one module per subsystem, each staged behind its own lg.* command-line
# word. Subsystems mainline already serves (SDHCI, SPMI, WLED, RMI4 touch,
# wcnss_ctrl, qrtr) need no module here -- only DT + config + firmware.

